            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Multidetector-row CT has shown over the past years that it is able to provide reliable diagnoses in various acute intestinal conditions. The presented article provides an overview of non-inflammatory acute intestinal pathologies, ranging from obstruction to ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
